    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “I have seen the affliction of my people who are in Egypt, and have heard their cry because of their taskmasters; I know their sufferings, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I have come down to deliver them out of the hand of the Egyptians, and to bring them up out of that land to a good and broad land, a land flowing with milk and honey, to the place of the Canaanites, the Hittites, the Amorites, the Perizzites, the Hivites, and the Jebusites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, behold, the cry of the people of Israel has come to me, and I have seen the oppression with which the Egyptians oppress them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come, I will send you to Pharaoh that you may bring forth my people, the sons of Israel, out of Egypt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Moses said to God, “Who am I that I should go to Pharaoh, and bring the sons of Israel out of Egypt?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, “But I will be with you; and this shall be the sign for you, that I have sent you: when you have brought forth the people out of Egypt, you shall serve God upon this mountain.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses said to God, “If I come to the people of Israel and say to them, ‘The God of your fathers has sent me to you,’ and they ask me, ‘What is his name?’ what shall I say to them?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said to Moses, “I AM WHO I AM.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or I AM WHAT I AM or I WILL BE WHAT I WILL BE",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And he said, “Say this to the people of Israel, ‘I AM has sent me to you.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God also said to Moses, “Say this to the people of Israel, ‘The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The word Lord when spelled with capital letters, stands for the divine name,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "YHWH,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "which is here connected with the verb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "hayah,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "to be",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of your fathers, the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob, has sent me to you’: this is my name for ever, and thus I am to be remembered throughout all generations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go and gather the elders of Israel together, and say to them, ‘The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your fathers, the God of Abraham, of Isaac, and of Jacob, has appeared to me, saying, “I have observed you and what has been done to you in Egypt; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I promise that I will bring you up out of the affliction of Egypt, to the land of the Canaanites, the Hittites, the Amorites, the Perizzites, the Hivites, and the Jebusites, a land flowing with milk and honey.” ’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they will hearken to your voice; and you and the elders of Israel shall go to the king of Egypt and say to him, ‘The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of the Hebrews, has met with us; and now, we pray you, let us go a three days' journey into the wilderness, that we may sacrifice to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I know that the king of Egypt will not let you go unless compelled by a mighty hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "no, not by a mighty hand",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I will stretch out my hand and smite Egypt with all the wonders which I will do in it; after that he will let you go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will give this people favor in the sight of the Egyptians; and when you go, you shall not go empty, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but each woman shall ask of her neighbor, and of her who sojourns in her house, jewelry of silver and of gold, and clothing, and you shall put them on your sons and on your daughters; thus you shall despoil the Egyptians.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
